-hoe-street-london","status":"Available","source_updated_at":"2025-11-07T17:12:31+00:00","title":"242 Hoe Street","summary":"Fully Fitted Sit down and Grab & Go Style Fast Food Premises on Busy East London High Street","address_line":"242 Hoe Street","area":"Walthamstow","city":"London","postcode":"E17 3AX","lat":51.583784,"lng":-0.019332,"property_type":"Restaurant","use_class":null,"disposal_type":"lease_assignment","to_let":true,"for_sale":false,"rent_pa":33000,"rent_raw":"£33,000 per annum","rent_period":"per annum","premium":null,"premium_raw":null,"guide_price":null,"price_qualifier":"on_application","vat_applicable":true,"rateable_value":null,"business_rates":null,"service_charge":null,"estate_charge":null,"parking_charge":null,"tenure_raw":"An assignment of the existing lease with 12 years remaining, subject to a rent review in 2 years and then 5 yearly thereafter.","lease_term_years":null,"lease_expiry":null,"rent_review_basis":null,"next_rent_review":null,"inside_1954_act":null,"size_sqft":1100,"size_sqm":102.19,"covers_internal":null,"covers_external":null,"floors":[{"name":"Ground - Restaurant","sqft":1100,"sqm":102.19}],"licensing_notes":null,"fit_out_state":"fully_fitted","epc_rating":null,"description":"The property comprises a ground floor restaurant unit forming part of a traditional terrace on the east side of Hoe Street. The unit benefits from excellent street frontage, strong visibility, and consistent local trade from the surrounding residential and commercial community.<br />\n<br />\nThe accommodation is arranged on the ground floor, currently fitted to a good restaurant specification, providing both dine-in and takeaway capability.<br />\n<br />\nKey features include:<br />\n<br />\nWide glazed shopfront with excellent street presence<br />\n<br />\nCustomer seating area with counter servery<br />\n<br />\nFully fitted commercial kitchen with extract system (Electric) <br />\n<br />\nAir conditioning and modern lighting throughout<br />\n<br />\nAncillary storage and WC facilities to the rear<br />\n<br />\nThe premises are in good condition and suitable for continued use as a restaurant, café, or takeaway.","location_description":"The property is prominently located on Hoe Street, in the heart of Walthamstow, one of East London’s most vibrant and fast-evolving neighbourhoods. Hoe Street serves as a key arterial route through Walthamstow, linking Walthamstow Central with Lea Bridge Road, and benefits from high pedestrian and vehicular traffic throughout the day.<br />\n<br />\nWalthamstow Central Station (Victoria Line and London Overground) is less than a 5-minute walk away, offering direct connections to King’s Cross, Oxford Circus, and Liverpool Street, making the location highly accessible to both local residents and visitors.<br />\n<br />\nNearby occupiers include Franco Manca, Nando’s, Pizza Express, and a variety of independent cafés, breweries, and creative studios, contributing to the area’s dynamic and youthful atmosphere.","key_features":["High Footfall Location","Fully Fitted Grab & Go Style Food Premises","Close to Key Name Operators","Recently Refurbished","Busy Location Every Day Of The Week"],"sections":[{"title":"Description","content":"The property comprises a ground floor restaurant unit forming part of a traditional terrace on the east side of Hoe Street. The unit benefits from excellent street frontage, strong visibility, and consistent local trade from the surrounding residential and commercial community.<br />\n<br />\nThe accommodation is arranged on the ground floor, currently fitted to a good restaurant specification, providing both dine-in and takeaway capability.<br />\n<br />\nKey features include:<br />\n<br />\nWide glazed shopfront with excellent street presence<br />\n<br />\nCustomer seating area with counter servery<br />\n<br />\nFully fitted commercial kitchen with extract system (Electric) <br />\n<br />\nAir conditioning and modern lighting throughout<br />\n<br />\nAncillary storage and WC facilities to the rear<br />\n<br />\nThe premises are in good condition and suitable for continued use as a restaurant, café, or takeaway."},{"title":"Tenure","content":"An assignment of the existing lease with 12 years remaining, subject to a rent review in 2 years and then 5 yearly thereafter."},{"title":"Passing Rent","content":"£33,000pax"},{"title":"Premium","content":"Upon Application to include the leasehold interest and all fixtures and fittings"},{"title":"VAT","content":"All figures quoted may be subject to VAT"},{"title":"Holding Deposit","content":"A holding deposit will be required to secure the property which will allow a period of exclusivity and will be held in the CDG Leisure client account."}],"agent_name":"Morris Greenberg","agent_email":"morris@cdgleisure.com","agent_phone":"0207 100 5520","agent_photo":"https://as-images.imgix.net/600c00648e2a5fd30d8e13c5f877c55b-mo%20pic.jpg","images":[{"url":"https://as-images.imgix.net/1d78529760fc8d5b2240c8e8bb9cacd7-pic-1.jpg","alt":"242 Hoe Street, London, Restaurant Lease Assignment - pic 1.jpg","source_url":"https://as-images.imgix.net/1d78529760fc8d5b2240c8e8bb9cacd7-pic-1.jpg?mark=https%3A%2F%2Fas-images.imgix.net%2F5fcc3b7220158f27f85989bfa2708db8-screenshot-2024-06-19-at-14-54-05-removebg-preview.png&mark-alpha=90&mark-scale=30&mark-align=right,bottom"},{"url":"https://as-images.imgix.net/5b331e9826b6dbcce69fe8544b4e9cbd-pic-2.jpg","alt":"242 Hoe Street, London, Restaurant Lease Assignment - pic 2.jpg","source_url":"https://as-images.imgix.net/5b331e9826b6dbcce69fe8544b4e9cbd-pic-2.jpg?mark=https%3A%2F%2Fas-images.imgix.net%2F5fcc3b7220158f27f85989bfa2708db8-screenshot-2024-06-19-at-14-54-05-removebg-preview.png&mark-alpha=90&mark-scale=30&mark-align=right,bottom"},{"url":"https://as-images.imgix.net/d0301a43373c7ed2073bacda3d4a364d-pic-3.jpg","alt":"242 Hoe Street, London, Restaurant Lease Assignment - pic 3.jpg","source_url":"https://as-images.imgix.net/d0301a43373c7ed2